So yes, it doesn't matter what the world thinks about the church.

737
00:33:58,799 --> 00:33:59,933
They treat us in an evil way.

738
00:34:00,000 --> 00:34:03,716
May it be because of our holiness is offensive to their sinfulness.

739
00:34:04,033 --> 00:34:07,200
Now, we're going to continue this next week and break down more of the text.

740
00:34:07,266 --> 00:34:11,033
But this morning, what has following Christ cost you?

741
00:34:12,333 --> 00:34:14,233
This is a question that I've asked both weeks.

742
00:34:14,283 --> 00:34:16,383
2 weeks in a row to the students at all branch.

743
00:34:16,750 --> 00:34:19,866
What has following Christ cost you?

744
00:34:24,066 --> 00:34:25,983
This morning, I want you to take inventory of your life.

745
00:34:27,083 --> 00:34:29,050
You say, well, salvation is free, preacher.

746
00:34:29,349 --> 00:34:32,349
People like to get cute sometimes with me and answer all these

747
00:34:32,349 --> 00:34:34,916
deep answers and try to get...

748
00:34:34,983 --> 00:34:36,416
Listen, hey, salvation is free.

749
00:34:36,483 --> 00:34:36,833
Good for you.

750
00:34:36,900 --> 00:34:37,800
There's a gold star.

751
00:34:37,866 --> 00:34:38,633
Praise God that it is free.

752
00:34:38,699 --> 00:34:40,500
However, I need you to know something.

753
00:34:40,800 --> 00:34:43,433
Living for Jesus in a world that hates him is not free.

754
00:34:44,283 --> 00:34:45,533
It's quite costly.

755
00:34:47,283 --> 00:34:49,800
And if it isn't, what does it say about our faith?

756
00:34:52,433 --> 00:34:54,066
What has bad eyes closed all over this place?
